Modification list (one-to-one with dirtyfrag/patches/):
  0001-add-musu-manager.patch
      Added org.musu.next (MuSu Next, package org.musu.next) to the accepted
      SU-manager set; libksud.so is staged from that manager; a runtime guard
      refuses any other manager selection.
  0002-locked-mode.patch
      Added locked mode: intent extra
      "org.musu.next.dirtyfrag.LOCKED_MANAGER" with value "org.musu.next"
      pins the manager and skips the SU-manager chooser UI.
  0003-no-launcher.patch
      Removed the android.intent.category.LAUNCHER category so the engine has
      no standalone launcher icon; it is started by MuSu Next via an explicit
      component name.

The kernel modules in app/src/main/jni/ko/ are unmodified upstream binaries
from the commit named above; they are shipped as-is with their original
sha256 values recorded in README.md and SOURCE.txt.
